## Test Anti-Pattern Audit: `ProductCatalogTests.cs`

This is a textbook **"coverage-touching" test suite** — every production method is called (achieving high line coverage) but almost nothing is actually verified. These tests will pass even if the production code returns garbage or corrupts data.

---

### Severity-Ranked Findings

#### 🔴 CRITICAL — Assertion-Free Tests (tests prove nothing)

| # | Test Method | Problem |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `AddProduct_Works` (L17-21) | **Zero assertions.** Would pass even if `Save()` silently discards the product. |
| 2 | `UpdatePrice_Works` (L33-35) | **Zero assertions.** Never checks that the price actually changed. A bug in `p with { Price = newPrice }` is invisible. |
| 3 | `RemoveProduct_Works` (L38-42) | **Zero assertions.** Never checks the product is gone afterwards. |
| 4 | `GetProductCount_Works` (L63-66) | **Zero assertions.** Doesn't even check the count value (which is 0 here — questionable setup). |
| 5 | `ApplyBulkDiscount_Works` (L68-74) | **Zero assertions.** This is a complex mutation — 10% discount applied to all products — and nothing verifies the resulting prices. |
| 6 | `ImportFromCsv_Works` (L85-88) | **Zero assertions.** Never verifies the imported products exist in the store. |

#### 🟠 HIGH — Trivial/Shallow Assertions (false confidence)

| # | Test Method | Problem |
|---|---|---|
| 7 | `GetProduct_Works` (L25-29) | `Assert.IsNotNull` only. Never checks that `result.Sku == "SKU-001"` or price/name are correct. Would pass if `FindBySku` returned a completely wrong product. |
| 8 | `SearchProducts_Works` (L47-52) | `Assert.IsNotNull` on a `List<>` (which is never null from LINQ `.ToList()`). Never checks count or content. Would pass if search returned zero results or the wrong product. |
| 9 | `GetAllProducts_Works` (L55-60) | Same — `Assert.IsNotNull` on a list. Never checks `all.Count == 1`. |
| 10 | `ExportToCsv_Works` (L77-82) | `Assert.IsNotNull` on a string. Never checks CSV format, content, or delimiter. |

#### 🟡 MEDIUM — Missing Negative/Edge-Case Tests

| # | Missing Scenario | Risk |
|---|---|---|
| 11 | `UpdatePrice` with non-existent SKU | `KeyNotFoundException` behavior untested — could regress to silent no-op. |
| 12 | `ImportFromCsv` with malformed input | No test for missing fields, bad decimals, empty lines — production crash risk. |
| 13 | `ApplyBulkDiscount` with 0% or >100% | Boundary conditions untested. |
| 14 | `GetProduct` for missing SKU | Never verifies `null` is returned. |

---

